{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯衛星通訊社周三（14日）報道，中國外長王毅在阿塞拜疆首都巴庫會晤俄羅斯外長拉夫羅夫時表示，國家主席習近平將在下月的亞太經合組織（APEC）會議期間，與俄羅斯總統普京會晤，峰會對亞太地區發展十分重要。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.464551+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T01:40:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:17:45.039962+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416450+00:00","content_hash":"701745f876bd03205afad87846c75e62feb5faefde89f617e8fe4b7d18e6c111","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}